  "description": "This sportive e-mountain bike hardtail features a 120 mm suspension fork and 29\" wheels for a smooth and comfortable ride off-road. The Bergamont E-Revox Sport brings everything you need for a great day out on the trails: the classic derailleur drivetrain for efficient pedaling and shifting is a lightweight and proven concept for fast off-roading and the hydraulic disc brakes offer superior braking power and modulation even in adverse weather conditions.\n\nThe Bosch Performance Line CX electric drive system offers powerful and long-lasting support, giving you the freedom to explore beyond your usual routes and to push your boundaries.\n\nThe high-capacity Bosch PowerTube battery integrated into the frame can be removed for remote charging, while the battery cover remains on the bike to protect the empty battery bay from the elements. With the Bosch Smart System advanced connectivity features and upgrades are available: Use the eBike Flow App to control your bike or add optional extras like a Bosch PowerMore battery for increased range.",
